Band Description: A trio of grizzled engineers who operate the ship’s waste-processing plant by day and perform in the cooling vents by night. Led by Elara Vane, whose voice sounds like gravel crushed in a hydraulic press, they play with a stoic, detached intensity, rarely acknowledging the crowd, focusing entirely on the rhythmic alignment of their gear.

